WEBVTT

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.400
Thanks for tuning in, folks.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:09.580
This is Wellgreens, Kearny
Mesa location, located at 8039

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.960
Balboa. Right next to the 163 Freeway,
plenty of parking for everybody.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.300
Opened in 2022, quickly becoming
one of our standout locations.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.740
Opened from 6am to 9:55pm
every day of the week.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:25.600
Come see us.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.780
We would love to take care of you.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.180
Customer service is another key
part of the Wellgreens experience.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.500
We take pride in treating every customer
like family and we believe our return

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:36.340
policy is the best in San Diego.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:41.080
If you have a defective product, bring it
back within 7 days and we'll help arrange

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.360
an exchange for a
properly working product.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:48.700
Also as a courtesy, we offer two returns
per calendar year if you're not totally

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:49.860
satisfied with a purchase.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:54.300
Bring it back within 7 days as long as
there's half of the product left and we'll

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.220
work with you to find
something you'll be happy with.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:00.100
If you found us online or through Weedmaps
or one of our billboards around town,

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:04.820
first-time patients can receive 50% off
by mentioning the referral at check-in.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:10.440
We also offer daily specials on 15 or more
products at every location from Vista to

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:11.800
Encinitas to Chula Vista.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:16.100
Specials change each quarter and we
price-match qualifying competitor offers.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:22.160
Working with Wellgreens
is a very big privilege.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:23.760
I love the team.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.020
I love the environment, especially having
multiple store location experience under

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:32.060
my belt. I've seen a lot of
what Wellgreens has to offer.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:36.900
I think my favorite part is learning the
experience of the cannabis industry and

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.460
actually being involved in the business.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:43.500
I'm very fortunate for it, but this company
is growing really fast and it's a great

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.180
opportunity to dip our toes into something
great, something that benefits our

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:52.380
future. Well, for

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.740
one reason is it opens at 6 a.m.

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:55.620
That is fantastic.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.700
Secondly, they have great sales on stuff.

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:03.700
They have house brands and the staff is
extremely knowledgeable, helpful and kind

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.800
and they're constantly having new specials
and this is the best place to come.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.480
This is it. This is the
dispensary to come to.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:12.420
Thanks for watching.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:13.500
See you soon, friends.
